            "expanded_content": "<p>Having been online shops for over 4 years, opening a physical space has always been a dream of ours. After months of dedication and hard work, we are excited to invite you to our showroom nestled in the historic Chinatown of Vancouver.</p><p>Commune showroom is a space to showcase garments and objects that we admire and cherish. We believe that in-person shopping experience has become ever more invaluable, and the designers work can only be fully appreciated when one can see, feel, and wear the pieces. </p><p>We have also prepared a selection of vintage magazines and other in-store exclusives just for you. Join us at Commune, where every visit is an opportunity to learn, connect, and have fun!</p><p><strong>Hours:</strong> Every Friday - Sunday (1:00 - 6:00 PM) by appointment only</p><p><strong>Address: </strong>268 - 237 Keefer St,<br/>Vancouver, BC, Canada<br/>V6A 1X6</p><p>Click <a href=\"https://calendly.com/commune237/showroomappointment\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://calendly.com/commune237/showroomappointment\"><strong>here</strong></a><strong> </strong>to book your showroom visit.</p>"
